"st": "background: #C00000; color: #FFFFFF; vertical-align: middle;",
"ps": [
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"3. Audit Objectives"
]
],
"st": "font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;"
}
]
}
]
},
{
"cells": [
{
"st": "vertical-align: middle;",
"ps": [
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"The audit objectives are the following:"
]
],
"st": "font-size: 9pt;"
},
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"1. Determination of the conformity of the client’s management system, or parts of it, with audit criteria within the scope of the Management System."
]
],
"st": "font-size: 9pt; text-align: justify;"
},
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"2. Determination of the ability of the management system to ensure the client organization meets applicable statutory, regulatory, and contractual requirements."
]
],
"st": "font-size: 9pt; text-align: justify;"
},
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"3. Determination of the effectiveness of the management system to ensure the client organization can reasonably expect to achieve its specified objectives."
]
],
"st": "font-size: 9pt; text-align: justify;"
},
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"4. As applicable, identification of areas for potential improvement of the management system."
]
],
"st": "font-size: 9pt; text-align: justify;"
},
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"5. Review of any management system’s changes."
]
],
"st": "font-size: 9pt; text-align: justify;"
},
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"6. Validation that the management system was effectively applied in the previous period (valid for surveillance or recertification audits) and to verify its readiness for the coming period."
]
],
"st": "font-size: 9pt; text-align: justify;"
},
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"The audit was carried out according to the relevant applicable procedure for Management Systems Certification and the relevant Regulation for Certification of TÜV AUSTRIA. The basic information documenting the results of the audit are included into this audit questionnaire, and in total, into the report, the copies of documents and other evidence obtained during the audit."
]
],
"st": "font-size: 9pt;"
}
]
}
]
},
{
"cells": [
{
"st": "vertical-align: top;",
"ps": [
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"CHARACTERIZATION OF FINDINGS"
]
],
"st": "font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold;"
}
]
}
]
},
{
"cells": [
{
"st": "vertical-align: top;",
"ps": [
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"1: Full Compliance"
]
],
"st": "font-size: 7pt;"
}
]
}
]
},
{
"cells": [
{
"st": "vertical-align: top;",
"ps": [
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"2: Observation, the effectiveness of the corrective action is evaluated during the next audit"
]
],
"st": "font-size: 7pt;"
}
]
}
]
},
{
"cells": [
{
"st": "vertical-align: top;",
"ps": [
{
"parts": [
[
null,
"3: Minor Non-Conformity(-ies): reviewed and accepted the client’s plan for correction and corrective action"
]
],
"st": "font-size: 7pt;"
}
]
}
]
},
{
"cells": [
{
"st": "vertical-align: top;",
"ps": [
{
"parts": [
[
null,
